{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0FuaW1hdGlvbi8yMDEwLS1CZWZvcmUvQ29sb3VyZnVsJTIwJTI4MjAxMCUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Colourful","description":"Upon reaching the train station to death, a dejected soul is informed that he is lucky and will have another chance at life. He is placed in the body of a 14-year-old boy named Kobayashi Makoto, who has just committed suicide. Watched over by a neutral spirit named Purapura, the soul must figure out what his greatest sin and mistake in his former life was, before his time limit in Makoto's body runs out. He also has a number of other lesser duties he must complete, such as understanding what led Makoto to commit suicide in the first place and learning how to enjoy his second chance at life.\n\nRated PG-13 · Released 21 Aug 2010 · Japan · Language: Japanese · 127 min\nStudio: SUNRISE, Ascension\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2010","genres":["Animation","Drama","Family","Animation"],"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/aSM1ki4WSEgvPYMZ9K28aylImFF.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/prs7S1Gp6UL2ByRaZdbmEGNwLOP.jpg","imdbRating":"7.2","imdb_id":"tt1677561","moviedb_id":64246,"tmdbId":64246,"runtime":"127 min","cast":["Kazato Tomizawa","Akina Minami","Aoi Miyazaki","Jingi Irie","Akiyoshi Nakao","Kumiko Aso","Katsumi Takahashi","Michael"],"director":["Keiichi Hara"],"writer":["Eto Mori","Miho Maruo"],"released":"2010-08-21T00:00:00.000Z","country":"Japan","language":"Japanese","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Keiichi Hara","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8ormRfEq9wIpxVOGNrbPWw9DD81.jpg"},{"name":"Kazato Tomizawa","character":"Makoto Kobayashi (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/va9WBGPYEmCmAqnrIvZJVddOi7j.jpg"},{"name":"Akina Minami","character":"Hiroka Kuwabara (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ffMR0tEjfyfFXjYA8pbSRvx765A.jpg"},{"name":"Aoi Miyazaki","character":"Shoko Sano (voice)","photo":"http